Changes by date
===============

=20261106=
* Fixed owners showing as ??? : ImpFE now finds its player number even if
  the player name's capitalisation differs from the server's (the server
  ignores case) or the name was typed at the login prompt, and refreshes
  ship data saved without an owner
* Connecting to the server no longer freezes ImpFE: it connects in the
  background, gives up after 20 seconds, can be cancelled with Close
  Connection, reports why a connection failed, and supports IPv6
* Version 0.3.0
* Fixed ImpFE appearing to hang when creating a new player: questions the
  server asks without a newline are now shown, password answers are hidden,
  and a player name typed at the login prompt is sent in ImpFE mode
* Fixed "Invalid configuration line found" when opening a database whose
  player name or password was never set; blank lines and Windows line
  endings in .fe files are accepted, and errors show the bad line
* Snap: moved to snap/snapcraft.yaml, core24 base and the GNOME extension,
  built from source (amd64 and arm64), with network/home access and a
  desktop launcher
* Converted the GUI from XForms to GTK 3
* Replaced autoconf with a plain Makefile (Linux only)
* Fixed a buffer overflow that crashed the planet census
* Fixed reading numbers into 64-bit variables in parse.c and feconfig.c
  (counts loaded from .fe files and server reports could be garbage)
* Builds with no compiler warnings: fixed the remaining printf formats,
  report failures to enter the database directory or to create the
  sector bitmap (a short bitmap file used to crash ImpFE), and bounded
  the file name and command buffers
=20150706=
bumped max players to 254
=20150530=
* Added man page
